<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "inLanguage": "en", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "Do I need documents to get a .com.tr domain?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. Since TRABİS went live in 2022, .com.tr, .net.tr and .org.tr domains have been allocated to the first applicant without documentation. Documents are still required for extensions reserved for certain institutions, such as .av.tr, .edu.tr or .gov.tr."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Should I buy my domain and hosting from the same company?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "It isn’t required. Buying from one company simplifies management; using separate companies means you don’t put your domain at risk when changing hosts. What matters is that the domain is registered in your name and the panel is under your control."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What happens if my domain expires?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "An expired domain is first suspended, and the site and email stop working. If it isn’t renewed within a set grace period, it is deleted and released for re-registration; at that point someone else can take it. Auto-renewal and an up-to-date contact email eliminate this risk."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "What hosting is enough for a corporate site?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "For a corporate brochure site with a few thousand visits a month, good-quality shared or managed hosting is usually enough. For projects involving e-commerce, memberships or custom software, a VPS or cloud server is the better choice."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is .com or .com.tr better for SEO?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Both are fine for SEO. .com.tr automatically signals that you are targeting Türkiye; with .com you can send the same signal through language, content and Search Console settings. Choose based on your target market and how memorable your brand is."}}]}</script>
